        "date": "2026-11-09T19:45:52Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): a touch probe section starts no spindle on any mill post\n\nHaas, Tormach, Sinumerik, Heidenhain and Mazak posted \"S<rpm> M3\" (or\nMOTON) for every section, a probe's S0 included. Each now gates its\nspindle start on sRpm > 0, the rule fanuc.cps has used since #108.\nTools refuse rpm 0, so only a probe reaches it; every post's section-end\nM5 already leaves the spindle stopped for the next section.\n\nPinned by probe_spindle::{a_section_with_no_spindle_speed_starts_no_spindle_on_any_mill_post,\na_cutting_section_still_starts_its_spindle_on_every_mill_post}.\n\nFixes #523\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
